msgid "OpenEMS: Data transfer to the backend"
msgstr "OpenEMS: Datenübertragung zum Backend"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/cloud-interfaces/backend-data-transfer.adoc
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/data/history-rrd4j.adoc
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/devices/controllable-inverters.adoc
